User update — this week

We made several improvements to make Meeshy smoother and easier to use:

- Faster, more reliable messaging and automatic reconnection when the network blips.
- Smarter mentions: when you type @ we now suggest names and people get notified more reliably.
- Easier message editing: edited messages keep their translations and mentions.
- Clearer notifications and search in the notifications page.
- Better audio recording on mobile with new real-time voice effects and presets.
- Small visual and accessibility fixes and improved language support.

Thanks for using Meeshy — keep the feedback coming!
